      "notes": "Must be HIGH or floating on reboot. Real Olimex Rev A schematic confirms an onboard LED (net GPIO8\\LED1, generic non-addressable \"OLIMEX_Diodes:LED\" symbol) but does NOT confirm it as WS2812/NeoPixel — this pins_arduino.h's RGB_BUILTIN/RGB_BRIGHTNESS/rgbLedWrite() macros are unmodified boilerplate inherited from Espressif's generic esp32h2 chip template (which targets Espressif's own WS2812-equipped DevKitM-1, not Olimex's hardware). No led_* capability tag applied — see pfodWeb NOTE above / boardsDetails notes.txt"
    },
