      "notes": "Must be HIGH for normal boot. Real Olimex Rev A schematic confirms an onboard user pushbutton (net GPIO9\\BUT1, OLIMEX_Buttons:T1107A tactile switch) — tagged button; digital_output/pwm_output capabilities removed since this is a dedicated input-only button pin, see pfodWeb NOTE above"
